cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pdfnative-react, please cite it as below."
title: pdfnative-react
abstract: >-
  A declarative React renderer for the pdfnative PDF engine. JSX is compiled by
  a custom React reconciler into a pdfnative DocumentParams object and rendered
  to PDF bytes — no DOM, no headless browser, no native dependencies. Fine
  typography, CMYK and PDF/X-4 print output, tagged PDF/A, native vector
  charts, byte-reproducible rendering, and a token-frugal DocSpec grammar with
  versioned JSON Schemas for autonomous agents.
type: software
authors:
